ica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小米公开MiMo-V2.6大模型RL训练过程 罗福莉发文确认将开源技术细节</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic整合Claude应用并推出Docs与Slides测试版功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云发布 Wan3.0 视频大模型，支持单条 30 秒长镜头与五条视频参考</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8f3df803703ab7e57b3c7d8678a52085.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云正式发布全新升级的 Wan3.0 视频大模型，实现了单条直出 30 秒长镜头的技术突破，显著提升了视频生成的连贯性与时长。该模型引入了核心的 omni-reference 全能多视频参考机制，支持同时引入多达五条视频作为参考素材，为用户提供导演级的精细控制能力，有效解决了以往视频生成需拼接大量短片段的痛点，更适配影视行业的专业生产流程。目前，Wan3.0 的相关能力已通过 Model Studio 和 Qwen Cloud 向开发者及企业用户开放 API 接口。这一升级标志着 AI 视频生成技术在复杂叙事与风格统一性上迈出重要一步，开发者可直接将该模型接入现有影视制作工作流，大幅提升创作效率与画面质量。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包联合火山引擎发布AI原生座舱助手，年内落地多款上汽车型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4295ae3ae464d7b8edf456594d4c7e0a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月17日，豆包与火山引擎联合发布AI原生车载助手——豆包座舱助手。该助手作为整车统一“大脑”，深度贯穿“感知-决策-执行”闭环，可实时感知数百种车辆信号，并调配车控、导航、辅助驾驶及娱乐等数千个原子能力，具备复杂任务的自动拆解与分步执行能力。目前，该产品已与上汽集团达成深度合作，首款搭载车型荣威家越07将于年内开启预售，上汽奥迪相关车型亦计划年内亮相。此外，豆包座舱助手将上线“手车互联”功能，支持移动端远程控车、车况查询及跨端内容推送。此次发布标志着大模型技术从单一语音交互转向对整车硬件与控制系统的深度接管，推动智能座舱向具备自主规划能力的Agent演进，为汽车产业提供软硬协同的智能化范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米公开MiMo-V2.6大模型RL训练过程 罗福莉发文确认将开源技术细节</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f13178d15cdde744635fba53f604abf7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米公开MiMo-V2.6大模型RL训练过程 罗福莉发文确认将开源技术细节AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 17, 2026609月17日凌晨，小米MiMo大模型团队负责人、前DeepSeek研究员罗福莉在X平台发文，首次公开旗下最新大模型MiMo-V2.6的强化学习（RL）训练进展，并同步上线实时训练页面，开启大模型RL阶段的全程公开直播。此举标志着小米在物理世界与通用智能(AGI)道路上的探索迈入全新突破期，相关技术细节亦计划于未来数周内逐步开源。技术架构上，MiMo-V2.6正在开展大规模多任务智能体（Agent）RL实验。团队围绕三大维度进行全面扩展:算力层面实现单步约20亿Token(1568个Prompt×16次rollout)的完全异步并行。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic整合Claude应用并推出Docs与Slides测试版功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/26f69e866147186bae40f28e539c0098.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic宣布将Claude Chat与Cowork功能合并为统一应用，打破入口限制，支持在同一对话窗口调用聊天、Cowork及Design能力。此次更新深度整合Claude Design并升级底层记忆机制，用户可自主切换工作模式。同时，Anthropic推出处于Beta阶段的Claude Docs与Claude Slides功能。Docs支持实时协作、内容生成及周期性任务自动化；Slides支持演示文稿生成、修改及导出为PowerPoint或PDF格式。功能推送采取分阶段策略，优先面向Pro和Max计划用户，随后覆盖Team和Free计划。企业版管理员可自主决定Docs与Slides的启用时间，以确保内部数据安全与管理节奏。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
